      "id": "R01",
      "existing_surface": "`modules/git/git.go`, backend setting",
      "required_patch": "Add explicit backend selection and a Ruk capability handshake carrying the backend's real identity, object formats, supported operation set, and merge modes. Keep stock Git mode for reference deployments. Replace all production version-derived feature decisions with capabilities. Ruk reports its real identity, not a fabricated Git version.",
      "source": "local://ruk-forgejo-contract-plan.md, 'Forgejo patch points' (revised table, row order preserved)"
    },
    {
      "id": "R02",
      "existing_surface": "`modules/git/command.go`; new `modules/git/backend` package",
      "required_patch": "Define one `Backend` interface in `modules/git/backend` with one method per typed operation, and two implementations: `Stock` keeps the existing subprocess builder and parsing for reference deployments, `Ruk` sends versioned JSON operation requests over a pooled connection and returns typed results. `modules/git` call sites call the interface, never argv. Errors are `*BackendError` with one closed code. Never parse text on the Ruk path.",
      "source": "local://ruk-forgejo-contract-plan.md, 'Forgejo patch points' (revised table, row order preserved)"
    },
    {
